## Positive control

33 variant drawings that Barthel gave for basic signs, fitted with the basic templates: mean coverage 0.97, median 0.98; 33% matched their own sign first; 100% reach the decomposition threshold.

If every decomposing sign were replaced by its parts, the head inventory would fall from 602 to 183 drawn signs, and 2561 of 3168 rare tokens (81%) would be rewritten with basic signs.

